  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Global Banking School (GBS), established in 2010, is a top private higher education provider in the UK. GBS offers you career-focused courses in banking, finance, business, and healthcare to prepare you for the job market. GBS also has campuses in Dubai and Malta, giving you a chance to experience a global learning environment.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>You’ll be part of a diverse student body spread across campuses in London, Manchester, Birmingham, Leeds, Dubai, and Malta. GBS is committed to providing academic support to ensure your success. The Academic Support team assists you with essay writing, presentations, and other academic skills. For personal matters, the Student Welfare Support Service offers confidential advice on mental health, disabilities, and other concerns.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>GBS does not provide on-campus accommodation. However, you can explore options like private student housing or homestays near the campus.</p><p>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The libraries at GBS provide you with print and online resources. You'll find everything you need from textbooks and journals to research papers and e-books. Plus, you’ll also have plenty of space for individual and group study.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
